{"bankId":"B-SRC-41-2810","section":"BAHAGIAN B","domain":"Matematik","repairType":"MATERIAL_REWRITE_CORE_DUPLICATE","reviewStatus":"EDITORIAL_REPAIRED_PENDING_QA","sourceDuplicateFamily":"B-CORE-DUP-0010","constructFamily":"repeated_departures_count","plannedLevel":4,"question":"Bas pertama bertolak pada 8:00 pagi dan bas seterusnya setiap 30 minit sehingga 11:00 pagi, termasuk kedua-dua waktu tersebut. Berapakah jumlah bas yang bertolak?","options":["6","7","8","9"],"answerIndex":1,"solutionSteps":["8:00 hingga 11:00 ialah 3 jam = 180 minit.","180 ÷ 30 = 6 sela masa.","Bilangan bas = 6 + 1 bas pertama = 7."]}
